# Paraglide JS compiled output (ADR-0005). Regenerated by `paraglide:compile`
# on every dev/build/check; gitignored (see .gitignore). The dir also ships its
# own nested .prettierignore, but Prettier only reads the root ignore file, so
# it must be listed here too.
apps/admin-template/src/lib/paraglide

# inlang project metadata (ADR-0005): everything under project.inlang/ is
# auto-generated (.meta.json, README.md, cache/) EXCEPT the hand-authored
# settings.json. The dir self-manages a nested .gitignore, but Prettier only
# reads this root file, so mirror the same rule here.
apps/admin-template/project.inlang/*
!apps/admin-template/project.inlang/settings.json

# M19 report demo (docs/report-plan.md §3.1): *.md here is the @banto/report
# template DSL (Markdown subset + {{ }} data-bind syntax), not prose.
# Prettier's Markdown table formatter rewrites `{{#each}}`/`{{/each}}`
# control lines into table cells (wraps them in `| ... |`), which the
# parser (packages/report/src/core/parse.ts) does not recognize as a
# row-repeat block anymore - silently breaking the template.
apps/admin-template/src/lib/banto/reports/*.md
